ative, has significant concerns, or indicates rejection, respond with **"No"**.\n- If the review is borderline or mixed, lean towards rejection unless the positive aspects clearly outweigh the negatives.\n\nReview Text:\n[Insert review here]\n\nOnly output **"Yes"** or **"No"**. Do not include any additional comments or reasoning. \n\n# Output format\nAnswer Yes or No as labels\n\n# Prediction\nText: {{ text }}\nLabel:']
